Title:          mTCP
Description:    A collection of TCP/IP tools
Summary:        A collection of UPX compressed TCP/IP tools: DHCP, IRC, FTP, Telnet, Netcat, HTGet, Ping, SNTP. This package does not include HTTPServ.
Keywords:       dos tcp/ip realmode dhcp ftp telnet htget irc ircjr netcat sntp ping opensource 16 bit
